<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN FIVE-WEEK T-NOTE YIELDS 4.910 PCT.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN FIVE-WEEK T-NOTE YIELDS 4.910 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield  Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   4.910	4.90-4.91   4.930</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 70)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield  Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS800 million   4.884	4.86-4.90   4.870 (July 30)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 29)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield  Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   4.851	4.84-4.86   4.838</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 30)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
